{
    "title": "SuitU: Fashion Avatar Dress Up",
    "description": "Release your fashion intuition, display your styling art and makeup skills, and enjoy the fun of creating your personal style.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Customize your makeup \r\nUse our DIY makeup tools to create your unique look and show your personality and style.\r\n\r\n- Compete and vote \r\nAccept various fashion challenges, compete with players worldwide, and vote to decide who can carry the outfit to the end.\r\n\r\n- Share fun with friends \r\nIn our gaming community, you can seek advice, make friends with other players, and share your unique styles.\r\n\r\n- Tell your fashion story \r\nShare your daily outfits, OOTD, etc., and express your fashion views and ideas.\r\n\r\n- Create your personal style \r\nUse our abundant resources, including outfits, hairstyles, makeup, accessories, and backgrounds, to design your own fashion style.\r\n\r\nSuitU provides you with a stage to show yourself and discover your personality. Here, you can create your own fashion story, design personalized styles, and share the fun of fashion with players around the world. Join us now and start your fashion journey!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Release your fashion intuition, display your styling art and makeup skills, and enjoy the fun of creating your personal style.<br><br>Features:<br>- Customize your makeup <br>Use our DIY makeup tools to create your unique look and show your personality and style.<br><br>- Compete and vote <br>Accept various fashion challenges, compete with players worldwide, and vote to decide who can carry the outfit to the end.<br><br>- Share fun with friends <br>In our gaming community, you can seek advice, make friends with other players, and share your unique styles.<br><br>- Tell your fashion story <br>Share your daily outfits, OOTD, etc., and express your fashion views and ideas.<br><br>- Create your personal style <br>Use our abundant resources, including outfits, hairstyles, makeup, accessories, and backgrounds, to design your own fashion style.<br><br>SuitU provides you with a stage to show yourself and discover your personality. Here, you can create your own fashion story, design personalized styles, and share the fun of fashion with players around the world. Join us now and start your fashion journey!",
